//
// File: zannastudio/src/commands/search_commands_support.zia
// Purpose: Stateless workspace, symbol, path-filter, text-match, and result helpers.
// Key invariants:
//   - Disk reads and result publication honor the same bounded search limits as the controller.
// Ownership/Lifetime:
//   - Helpers borrow project, document, location, and shell state only for each call.
// Links: zannastudio/src/services/search_matcher.zia, zannastudio/src/services/search_paths.zia
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

